'''Possessed King Doge''' (操られしわんわん大王, ''Ayatsura Reshi Wan Wan Daiō'', '''Possessed Great King Wan Wan''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Shadows over Doge Kingdom]]. He was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Possessed King Doge
|image = E 685.png
|first appearance = [[Shadows over Doge Kingdom]]
|money drop = 1,111¢ - 4,388¢
}}

==Enemy==
Considering his insane 1000 Range and his 100% freeze on all units, this Enemy should be handled with extreme caution. He attacks slowly, but it is [[Multi-Hit]] and guaranteed freezes all units within that range. Fast units can exploit this low attack rate.

==Strategy==
Excessive meatshielding isn't required due to his very long attack cooldown, but try to use Units that are Immune to [[Freeze]], such as [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Kung Fu]], [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize]], or Ubers like [[Lasvoss (Uber Rare Cat)|Lasvoss]] and [[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby]]. Also, use fast units, like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]].

